  "title": "趁他们没上来赶紧离开  (Sneaking Out of the Hospital Together)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Bu Xiaogu spots company executives and network officials heading upstairs to visit Chun Yuqiao, he talks her into sneaking out of the hospital together and heading home to his apartment for stomach medicine and rest. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好像公司高层还有领导都来看你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "趁他们没上来赶紧离开。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那怎么能行，你现在这么虚，不行！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚刚有点紧张，我现在胃有点不太舒服。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "家里有药吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有，进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你可以去厨房看看，冰箱里也许有吃的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，我不饿，我在那儿守着你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好像公司高层还有领导都来看你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It looks like senior company executives and officials have all come to visit you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "趁他们没上来赶紧离开。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us slip out quickly before they come upstairs.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那怎么能行，你现在这么虚，不行！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could we do that—you are still so weak right now, no way!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚刚有点紧张，我现在胃有点不太舒服。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sneaking past the nurses made me a little tense, and now my stomach feels uncomfortable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "家里有药吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have stomach medicine at home, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有，进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I do—come on in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你可以去厨房看看，冰箱里也许有吃的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Feel free to check the kitchen; there might be something to eat in the fridge.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，我不饿，我在那儿守着你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is fine, I am not hungry—I will sit over there and keep watch over you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好像公司高层还有领导都来看你了。",
